{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1401806-dark-eras-igniting-the-fire-stv","id":1401806,"title":"Dark Eras: Igniting the Fire [STV]","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-07-08T16:53:12-07:00","id":1401806,"title":"Dark Eras: Igniting the Fire [STV]","content":"Random Person: &quot;Hey, LostLight, you wrote, like, way too much homebrew content for Hunter. Why don't you make some for the Storyteller's Vault?&quot;<br /> <br /> Me: &quot;.... WE WERE ON A BREAK!&quot;<br /> <br /> ... ahem<br /> <br /> So here is the thing- I like Dark Eras, I like Hunter, and I personally feel that Hunter needs a lot more love in that series. One of the ideas which I played around with since, like, forever, was making a Sundered World expansion for Hunter. It was actually suppossed to be my first STV title, but then my sister and I got to some &quot;artistic differences&quot;, and the project got stuck together with my sister's creativity block. However, I have eventually managed to convince her, and so I have gathered all of my notes and finally made this new product. Hope you will like it!<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/319972/Dark-Eras-Igniting-the-Fire\" target=\"_blank\">You can find it in here</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>The world has never been as dark as it was in its earliest days.</i></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>The Forest. The Mountain. The Sea. The Winter. The Night. The Dead. The Living. The Others. Everything was a threat. Everything was an enemy. Everything was a danger. And then, the Wise came, turning the people to the People. However, the Wise are so few, and they are blinded by their power- and the darkness is so, so deep. The People must fight. The People must protect. Be them farmers and traders, potters and hunters and priests, each has their own role to fulfil, and to keep the People alive for one more night.</i></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>The world may be at its darkest- but the fire has never shined as bright as then.</i></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>Discovering the Fire is a Sundered World expansion, meant to give the tools to run and play a Hunter Chronicle during the Neolithic. This books includes:</i></span></span><ul><li>The many threats and enemies against the People must fight in order to survive, be them the hungry dead, the disastrous Wild Hunt or the murderous Others.</li> </ul><ul><li>Special roles for the People who uphold the Vigil, be them the emissaries of the Healers from the Forest, the outcast Grave-Stricken who speak for the dead or the barbarian communities who were Banished from the People.</li> </ul><ul><li>Two conspiracies which may have existed among the People- the Hunter Wolf Cult and the Guardians of the Flame.</li> </ul><ul><li>A new template to be used for both protagonists and antagonists, either for modern or Neolithic times- the Rmoahals</li> </ul><ul><li>New Endowments, the future which waits for those first carriers of the Vigil, and more</li> </ul>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-08T17:45:06-07:00","id":1401812,"title":"","content":"Love your fan materials - will surely buy it if preparing <i>Sundered World</i> game!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-08T21:28:08-07:00","id":1401849,"title":"","content":"Would you like us to report errata, or just leave it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-08T23:22:32-07:00","id":1401861,"title":"","content":"Imma buy this!<br /> <br /> Sorry you guys are fighting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-08T23:47:55-07:00","id":1401863,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1401806-dark-eras-igniting-the-fire-stv?p=1401849#post1401849\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Would you like us to report errata, or just leave it?</div> </div> </div> </div>It is a paid product, so it is my responsibility to make sure it is as high quality as possible- so please do. Not sure if in this threa (if you could PM it to me it could be nice, but whatever you feel more comfortable)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-08T23:50:25-07:00","id":1401864,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1401806-dark-eras-igniting-the-fire-stv?p=1401861#post1401861\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Imma buy this!<br /> <br /> Sorry you guys are fighting.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, we are not fighting (at least, not any more than the usual. We are siblings, after all). It was just a part of the usual &quot;I asked you to do one thing!&quot; vs &quot;I have creativity block!&quot; kind of argument we have from time to time :P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-08T23:52:50-07:00","id":1401865,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1401806-dark-eras-igniting-the-fire-stv?p=1401812#post1401812\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Love your fan materials - will surely buy it if preparing <i>Sundered World</i> game!</div> </div> </div> </div>While not directly trying to push you into buying the product, I just wish to clarify to all that while the product is made for the Neolithics (of course), some of the plot hooks, not to mention the rmoahals (which have variant rules to be used with Mage's rules) could be useful for a modern Chronicle (at least, that was my intention)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-10T03:15:32-07:00","id":1402031,"title":"","content":"I loved this book!! You and your sister are really good writers. I especially liked the Others and the Healers.<br /> <br /> I loved the Rmoahals too. Do you think there\u2019s a connection between the Rmoahals, the Atlanteans from M:tAw and the Lemurians from Genius: the Transgression?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-10T05:41:57-07:00","id":1402051,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1401806-dark-eras-igniting-the-fire-stv?p=1402031#post1402031\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I loved this book!! You and your sister are really good writers. I especially liked the Others and the Healers.<br /> <br /> I loved the Rmoahals too. Do you think there\u2019s a connection between the Rmoahals, the Atlanteans from M:tAw and the Lemurians from Genius: the Transgression?</div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you- just to clarify, I am the writer, while my sister is the artist. She made the cover art, as well as the art in the book. I really like how she protrayed one of the Nine Daughters in her lessons under Winter Wolf.<br /> <br /> I am glad you liked the Others and the Healers (my sister was personally very angry at me for not warning her that the Healers were a bit.. graphic, but it felt appropriate for the primal form of Cheiron to be very brutal). As for the Rmoahals (which is the name the Loyalists of Thule give to those beings, as per Witchfinders and Compacts &amp; Conspiracies), the Giants represent a different version of humanity- so they come from &quot;an Atlantis&quot; as much as any other civilization which came from a time which never was. They also have strong connection with the Pangaeans of Mountain and Winter, but the Wise (not to mention modern humanity) don't know much about the exact connection between them. So in short, the Giants are atlantean, representing a version of the World Before, and like every Atlantis, that one also came crushing upon the world as the Exarchs broke the world.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-10T08:31:19-07:00","id":1402073,"title":"","content":"Also, if you can, please review and rate the product. If I'll see that it is very successful, I may add some durther expansion for both the Enemy section and new Roles to represent other &quot;proto compacts/ conspiracies&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-10T14:24:19-07:00","id":1402117,"title":"","content":"Wow!!! That\u2019s awesome, especially the part about the Rmoahals.<br /> <br /> Nine Daughters? Who is the Ninth Firstborn?<br /> <br /> And okay. I will.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-10T16:14:57-07:00","id":1402135,"title":"","content":"On the subject of the Firstborn- there are a number of options. After all, Sundered World has presented the idea that Father Wolf had many children, only few of which have survived to modern Era. While I think that one of my Nibiru writeups have detailed which Firstborn I had in mind while writing the piece, I have deliberately left it open in the final product to let individual Storytellers the freedom to decide. If you prefer to try and guess them by yourself, the lessens that those Firstborn taught to the Daughters are the best hint you have in the book.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-10T17:46:39-07:00","id":1402149,"title":"","content":"Thanks. I forgot the part in Sundered World about Father Wolf having more than eight children.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-15T14:23:17-07:00","id":1402984,"title":"","content":"So as it seems, Igniting the Fire takes part in the Christmas in July sales, giving 25% off- so get it while it is on discount! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> On another note, following a review I got on the product, I am currently working on adding a bit more mechanics to the product in the form of new Endowments, which would probably also make it more useful for none Neolithic chronicles. I can't promise when it will be availble, but I am working on it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-21T01:08:22-07:00","id":1403774,"title":"","content":"I hope we can see an update for 2nd edition Hunter later.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-21T03:01:00-07:00","id":1403784,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FallenEco</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1401806-dark-eras-igniting-the-fire-stv?p=1403774#post1403774\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I hope we can see an update for 2nd edition Hunter later.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is the goal, but it may take some time- Geist 2e is out for a while, but it is yet to be opened for the STV, as far as I'm aware. While my original plan was waiting for 2e, but seeing how much time it could take have led me to publish it now. I guess that if there will be enough Hunter material on the STV, it may help to open 2e sooner, which will make everyone happy :P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-24T07:15:22-07:00","id":1404394,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-